{"seq":2,"slug":"tech-leadership-growth","title":"技术领导力与成长","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth","rating":{"composite":4.32,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":4.05,"verdict":"recommend","uScore":4.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"技术领导力与成长-简介\">技术领导力与成长 简介</h1><p>技术能力可以让你解决复杂问题，但技术领导力决定了你能影响多大范围的问题。从写出优秀的代码到带领团队做出正确的技术决策，这之间存在一段需要刻意修炼的距离。本手册聚焦于高级工程师向技术领导者转型过程中必须掌握的核心能力，涵盖角色转换、技术战略、影响力构建、职业发展与工程卓越五大领域。</p>\n<p>本手册适合有三到五年以上工程经验、正在经历或即将面临角色转变的软件工程师。无论你是刚被提升为 Tech Lead 的资深开发者，还是正在思考 Staff Engineer 路径的个人贡献者，又或者是希望系统性提升技术影响力的架构师，都能在这里找到可落地的方法论与思维框架。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>从 IC 到 Lead</strong>帮助你完成从个人贡献者到技术领导者的心态转型。你将理解两种角色在价值创造方式上的根本差异，学会通过授权而非亲自动手来放大团队产出，掌握向上管理的策略以获取资源与支持，并建立适合领导角色的时间管理体系。第二章<strong>技术战略</strong>带你从写代码的视角跃升到做技术决策的视角。你将学会用架构决策记录沉淀技术共识，在自建与采购之间做出理性权衡，构建团队的技术雷达以系统性地评估新技术，并设计安全可控的大规模技术迁移方案。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>无授权影响力</strong>是技术领导力的核心竞争力。你将掌握用技术写作清晰表达复杂想法的能力，学会在技术评审与全员会议中有效表达观点，通过 RFC 和设计文档驱动组织级技术决策，并在跨团队协作中对齐目标、化解分歧。第四章<strong>职业成长</strong>为你规划从 Senior 到 Staff 再到 Principal 的进阶路线图。你将理解不同层级工程师的核心能力模型，学会通过指导他人加速自身成长，并在组织内外建立技术影响力与个人品牌。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>工程卓越</strong>将视角从个人提升扩展到组织效能。你将学会定义和塑造工程文化，打造让开发者高效且愉悦的工作环境，选择真正反映团队健康度的工程指标，并为团队创造探索创新的空间与机制。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序阅读。前两章解决&quot;角色转型&quot;和&quot;决策能力&quot;两个最紧迫的问题，第三章和第四章在此基础上扩展影响力半径和职业纵深，第五章则将个人领导力升华为组织级的工程领导力。如果你已经在领导岗位上有一定经验，也可以直接跳到与当前挑战最相关的章节深入研读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ic-to-lead","title":"从 IC 到 Lead","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/ic-to-lead","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transition-mindset","title":"IC 到管理的思维转变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/ic-to-lead/transition-mindset"},{"seq":2,"slug":"delegating-effectively","title":"有效委派","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/ic-to-lead/delegating-effectively"},{"seq":3,"slug":"managing-up","title":"向上管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/ic-to-lead/managing-up"},{"seq":4,"slug":"time-management-for-leads","title":"技术领导时间管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/ic-to-lead/time-management-for-leads"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"technical-strategy","title":"技术战略","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/technical-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-decision-records","title":"ADR 架构决策记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/technical-strategy/architecture-decision-records"},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-vs-buy","title":"自建与采购决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/technical-strategy/build-vs-buy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-radar","title":"技术雷达","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/technical-strategy/technology-radar"},{"seq":4,"slug":"migration-strategies","title":"迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/technical-strategy/migration-strategies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"influence-without-authority","title":"无授权影响力","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/influence-without-authority","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technical-writing-for-impact","title":"技术写作影响力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/influence-without-authority/technical-writing-for-impact"},{"seq":2,"slug":"presentation-skills","title":"演讲技能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/influence-without-authority/presentation-skills"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rfc-and-design-doc","title":"RFC 和设计文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/influence-without-authority/rfc-and-design-doc"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cross-org-alignment","title":"跨组织对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/influence-without-authority/cross-org-alignment"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"career-growth","title":"职业成长","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/career-growth","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"staff-engineer-path","title":"Staff Engineer 之路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/career-growth/staff-engineer-path"},{"seq":2,"slug":"principal-engineer-path","title":"Principal Engineer 之路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/career-growth/principal-engineer-path"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mentoring-others","title":"指导他人","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/career-growth/mentoring-others"},{"seq":4,"slug":"building-reputation","title":"建立声誉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/career-growth/building-reputation"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"engineering-excellence","title":"工程卓越","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/engineering-excellence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"defining-engineering-culture","title":"定义工程文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/engineering-excellence/defining-engineering-culture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"developer-experience","title":"开发者体验（DX）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/engineering-excellence/developer-experience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metrics-that-matter","title":"关键指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/engineering-excellence/metrics-that-matter"},{"seq":4,"slug":"innovation-time","title":"创新时间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/tech-leadership-growth/engineering-excellence/innovation-time"}]}]}